# Gera docs/demo.gif:  vhs docs/demo.tape   (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs)
# Requer o nmap instalado. Usa só o alvo de prática scanme.nmap.org.
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Theme "Dracula"

Type "nscope" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "2" Sleep 600ms
Down 2 Sleep 800ms
Enter Sleep 600ms
Type "4" Sleep 2s
Type "3" Sleep 400ms
Right 3 Sleep 1s
Type "/" Type "udp" Sleep 1s
Escape Sleep 400ms
Type "5" Sleep 400ms
Type "r" Sleep 12s
Type "6" Sleep 1s
Right Sleep 600ms
Down Sleep 1s
Type "q"
